{"type":"message","id":"506b5605","parentId":"61910908","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:29:08.022Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A new session was started via /new or /reset. Execute your Session Startup sequence now - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning.\nCurrent time: Thursday, March 19th, 2026 — 10:29 PM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-03-19 14:29 UTC"}],"timestamp":1773930548009}}
{"type":"message","id":"52b363c5","parentId":"506b5605","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:29:12.859Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04a96f220883d2240169bc08364fb081918535b4d38360f9cd\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpvAg4ZoRE-NtO4RANv_XY35abd6WXA1M0z0X8B8Bb3Ft2MyqSdYeb82xjEyZsQf4b1PwM9o1p0MIDs4yuy5xs9krS5UmbfYbVAB9oWhCDwiMN70azBnOoHHuPQ_VMn9L8m2Mkt5E_QYg5RNZd7Bregtmn5qRWuNnsw6Tg-LGl6iJ5qH4LupMT9_iUvciaH58yw3PmZsIvhoy5s2pZgzvYjOB3b4-YXgCs6O_7TAAL9B5qs9-x4xmrvmM799fV8O5WhNyx4QhX1ktNDeG8VB97EXWe5TZBAvJwverKubalIDtIyQu904wI4SWn42j-f_GCZNvJjLAvoWE0bcUY7tq2gB_6XxY1B4pScwqtJCUwtlLLYJwDVRFi-HYOSuMfwMgGLnR0WJeWCXKxGo77GKcxRFYXcw4orCFBU2h1GlRyWiKe3h8r_iuc8UgwkoaH87GFBdRi8f28Jw0bdWGcueKeiswo88x9dIbATg0BVtMM9wDR90j_Nrect1U2M27iKjwOEqbBjy0JCh7AOF0bioOex5sfwyNAY6wpeuq44UxC6WIiikchglox7Ji6ztBA0msV5a7MzojkpzosH_dpfLWcovsGjrQLSnGHUJm64tFmlxZPJrz2EOcWTBwAQBZnrThrAQd1QpZt16CdbGiBMFkL4c_GUrjq18fAH48Q4rx8xRiQV0pOFog1PkqGDtyZQLtk-yecEyNshdza5K4x7kxD-lRihrvyAN908KBICEzDWZx60UQEV9UaqA-LWnC9r3AE3BsSkExW7F7uzEfebclJo5H_iFa2BD9OfDR1U-ynr5PvQQxciDWuGYt88L6-EOcfWYwQ1biz7oW5-DuiNjyq_T_7mTpWyooSdVidNymzewIaVd8eahs6n_00MDYUncmcZsRjHnsA_mP4BzPZl7_-7kQooDa1I9AIfOa1icaEUWpavFYtoHfuTzFZ1ShzTNXItxma18-oekyiH5_LE84_m8l0smA2RORWoDdssAW5qo0lmrfcHqbP_P3f4EaWo1PW5bLLeTodaMbUnOQfqMw1YbYzdYcz8w2n6lO5xmaYnhItgTNuvq5qnVJ9IJgk-FAD630tfyN5hT27zqGTFf8iag5UEGCIdJO9E4qPwjTh0ywGjklj-QMXmAPzB1yWKsaZhRffNBZDuaKCkUoZNxlWFWX2McxJFn89sWAQmmYhQsILJqwSxvZl-LxZKaiuClvUAkjS5vwW3KaKYyq9ADRWLYuFtA==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 主人，文文在 🤖 今晚我在线，保持直接高效模式。想先做什么：查资料、写东西、改配置，还是直接开干某个具体任务？","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04a96f220883d2240169bc0838376c819181c27ea872815e40\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":14516,"output":111,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16163,"cost":{"input":0.03629,"output":0.00