{"type":"message","id":"d1765a74","parentId":"8090b7e8","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:30:46.074Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering recommendations**\n\nI don't think there's a need for memory retrieval here since it's not necessary. I'll focus on crafting concise recommendations. It might be helpful to create a couple of options: perhaps one for three people and another for two. That way, I can present the user with flexible alternatives while keeping it simple. Let's see how this pans out!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04a96f220883d2240169bc0881b59081918fe612ad5ce99fba\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpvAiFkjI9wkRCD3-VxnND1pqDXBAF-zOeVzN8AIyyE3pE1sU4eCq8ekgHtFHLUYckBn_28-ZlJbXp4Gpfds94h6wYTyOAgSvXFXGQZg8aQZu9kexK5__-r0VDRBCXnQxRPw7AiWPXodmTEUqD7MqNMhSWsnRVwhhjDF_8_4VpcwRTtfI2OjU-BYSLmctD7wsUAdx-DgePiISF_bTM0msD5f6xP78lop6xoEMJ39Y8V4fw_kDUWVSM-wFPZgS8KrckGM_nzCA-2kyUaKdPa40uWqKW-gDVT34xzggfGS2iL85dRIO4Ho9XuQ8OGH1EFP-FMtKCn6NYGn4BinTqrmzG1NNspiL10MxlVMVhRh-fr1CMCwMC5BV4yxZdMOVTDm6PGAnOf6VCdpj2I0l0UHI4m-rEyu_JLFLChqIQPnY6PRuHyTI57CUyZDp9KMyEynWOlVOAqyHbalf6LTl0o2eAq6fflPjOAUQSBQtgKUxapNtI0pRWMxC67mgViifguC4_kw-Tb1yA6hSmAIJzIkoxrEeAh198_i1cGSXfvzoNzFJ7vtW4KTElh-5AOngbZJrvho58Qla60dnUWikFiU2rs6rAmznlKMnEk5uae_d6BCaC2pcZJRUOaaEzAJPh2h1hX_e6kzfzxzIYGbvLo9y_4pMUaXwbnZTlU7venL7blgFEo4VHF3pWMjQyDPzc_miiz4555pHdp4xVqOfQSYBG31C2NPllqqwCtZmZrf0Sh-f-cWPbFXCzx2X-Urt0qznAzcTEBICynm-66neDsx94HrhuxV-6XZ-NfBgHJvFrguMbHt1MHO7gTR0wNGRwwGZ9I06TcsU9QuOn6taS3D4PxQMPpllX_yqsdAuFDtKt2ogDbpYe3DwQbZapPMXOk6WQ16eWXekhJiJfp1_td472MJl1LnNY599oUpGJEFj1QNDSBCg34O4s-r4gIASula-PD5Da0kPhHyXeA3bRLM4DiG3QCw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering recommendations**\\n\\nI don't think there's a need for memory retrieval here since it's not necessary. I'll focus on crafting concise recommendations. It might be helpful to create a couple of options: perhaps one for three people and another for two. That way, I can present the user with flexible alternatives while keeping it simple. Let's see how this pans out!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以，而且**应该缩**。这类事一开始人太多，协调成本会先把产出吃掉。\n\n我建议直接砍成 **3 人最小可运行团队**：\n\n### 方案一：3 人版，最实用\n#### 1）负责人 / 总控\n负责：\n- 定优先级\n- 判断值不值得提 issue\n- 做最终质量把关\n- 决定走 issue、PR 还是内部留档\n\n#### 2）侦察 + 复现\n把原来的 **Research Scout + Reproduction Engineer** 合并  \n负责：\n- 找外部线索\n- 主动走查关键流程\n- 复现问题\n- 写最小复现步骤\n\n#### 3）诊断 + 交付\n把原来的 **Diagnostics Engineer + Issue & PR Engineer** 合并  \n负责：\n- 看日志\n- 缩小范围\n- 判断根因\n- 输出高质量 issue / PR / docs fix\n\n这套最合适。**3 个人就能闭环：发现 → 证据化 → 提交。**\n\n---\n\n### 方案二：2 人版，极限精简\n如果你只想先跑起来，用 **2 人** 也行：\n\n#### 1）负责人\n- 定方向\n- 卡质量\n- 审核是否提交\n\n#### 2）执行员\n合并全部执行工作：\n- 搜线索\n- 复现\n- 看日志\n- 写 issue\n\n缺点很明显：  \n**单点压力大，容易漏诊断和质量复核。**  \n但如果目前只是试运行，这个版本也能跑。\n\n---\n\n### 方案三：直接按你现有 5 Agent 体系，不额外建团队\n你现在 workspace 里本来就有：\n- main\n- research\n- execution\n- review\n- qa\n\n其实不需要再新建 5-7 个“专项成员”，可以直接映射成 **3 个职能组**：\n\n- **main**：负责人 / 总控\n- **research + execution**：线索发现 + 复现\n- **review + qa**：诊断复核 + 验收  \n  如果要正式提 issue，再由 main 统一交付\n\n这个比重新造一套组织更顺手。\n\n---\n\n## 我的建议\n别搞 5 人完整版，**先上 3 人版**。  \n因为现阶段最重要的不是“角色优雅”，而是：\n\n1. 能不能持续找到候选问题  \n2. 能不能把问题钉死  \n3. 能不能稳定产出高质量 issue\n\n这三件事，3 个人足够。\n\n---\n\n## 我给你的最终结论\n**推荐配置：3 人。**  \n再少可以，但会虚；再多现在没必要。\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接帮你把那份计划**改写成 3 人精简版团队规划**，包括：\n- 新的角色定义\n- 合并后的职责\n- 精简版 SOUL.md\n- 精简版工作流\n- 精简版 issue 流程\n\n你回我一句：**“改成 3 人版”**，我直接给你完整重写稿。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04a96f220883d2240169bc0885112c8191ac83ca4313fc9c82\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":234,"output":736,"cacheRead":21504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22474,"cost":{"input":0.000585,"output":0.01104,"cacheRead":0.005376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773930623342}}
