{"type":"message","id":"503edbe0","parentId":"7d86fcdb","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:37:37.342Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying preferences for agents**\n\nI’m thinking about whether I need to remember past preferences or if I can just answer directly regarding current agents. It might help to mention that I can rename them and how to specify this. I want to ensure I talk about session keys and how they can likely be changed through configurations in the init script or the openclaw.json file. It’s good to simplify things and talk about mnemonic aliases for clarity. Let's make this concise!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04a96f220883d2240169bc0a18b5bc819187783dce7bb6868e\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpvAodUDMalLhJC6p2nIWfPcVPjp6CXb7gy1q68sdQSE2udV0BZX6TrS1TT7Up1NtXzEU2boOKvQdlxne4OAcsu3xzTbxm2b6ItEIbPW0WV1d6iTNSJJ_xPuNb4i-1dcaz_j96VJ6xqhQWhu5E0rdLCE1V6t74Itm2fFMLqty9pfojPADZC53A1U2gkWLsd8BD7K1bBABAlPIKg5P88kQ126i1Z8R89YMhUwNEN5D3vUCQzrwhLRt98Y-K_WBsENRy_VGUs28cOsr2I71WgFHHItL6LDzYpIuei4_Ndi0DXOmE_L_q2pFDJ34KGuzz3y5zI_8PEBlbTEhKLKgcm_GV8CiPWJUho7BL3eE-UMdriEyfED5LMuDLZw9Kqm3VqMKtNF2ccTUfPK0nBXijsqxFrnUWByDcbKK-LNRQaTFAmp8Ohla0wY68VPuibTCc3ZMfbzXKas_pGXjQSYUDKkq-JXdwEgeWAxKeHjiTQCLFEBLWDbbMWljtmHreiLncPDYYvPqbBFOoyJrlyRNIw9QZF6sa1dqr2ckzUXcc5xuETmdhzyVDvJI68DRbdSjvdhPSvTB1PnWaG8P8nCYkiBgYfePE1deSphJffpg2tbpai3SJy3SsuKgWZ16nHwQ93i-tZlu10mN-H76Y2y_xbC6zSQvyzp70AN0cqAxrjXnUvX62axVUDFuVa3FyAZg9ULqDb3oEiIYYO1_ziYD4E7XWX0C2jrRWfmKR3sTQyEcy2inhKEjvoSby-RCUdIin_N0hg26UqZ1Nwp5kiuWF91B22ZCYqjTwzQtisHjKRRAhTRnj-KMhWDFFq0iJQjRz_jr9tD6Htn_W8SygCDAr8ZZX7Om-l2OsnEFli5R0E0HwxjilwQMMfWhitLsNBiVCYHgPUZFxrlpiumEZ1pyba7koy04aSm_rzk-E5VazwV5GvQVUbrNO3X0S1ksunuCxqeOl7wHnJ11_JT_qTxOGBQbMKllqCfKLwNZREnYRbTNZ6OgXfnNJ-TOb2U63nTxrwVizPpbz5MisZwlzlXEDkuV3baIJcpsRhl2msLMQTJcbo5eQkOy7DGLqmIcJ1qEmxbiesbdoBcBQ2EcDNMnBPtxoLsklcIQlcbGWzToEWbGkIZGtYN04-fJMtNfxDhrApnRMD0suhTl5J-3psCee5tIGxfmyTbmPcM19wjXWvpy4kPDdAPTu3hKOiARp2A9SnlaU5oL0V4p84GZdKAOtXS1j6O2f4-Ag3NnaeSi-I-z_4nxMjkOSoaxWW7coyJJkKDsjVtdtpBIURe5fWBJtUkUfU8WrX3QxtwMV_5onzcFKFeIXQjJO2JWkBuLCkm-kxRB5JMxg\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying preferences for agents**\\n\\nI’m thinking about whether I need to remember past preferences or if I can just answer directly regarding current agents. It might help to mention that I can rename them and how to specify this. I want to ensure I talk about session keys and how they can likely be changed through configurations in the init script or the openclaw.json file. It’s good to simplify things and talk about mnemonic aliases for clarity. Let's make this concise!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以改，而且**建议改**。  \n现在这几个名字太通用，不利于你一眼记住“谁干什么”。\n\n## 我建议改成中文直觉版\n- `research` → **情报员**\n- `execution` → **执行官**\n- `review` → **审查官**\n- `qa` → **验收官**\n\n如果你想保留一点技术味，也可以用这套：\n\n- `research` → **侦察员**\n- `execution` → **操盘手**\n- `review` → **复核员**\n- `qa` → **验证员**\n\n我个人更推荐第一套，记忆成本最低。\n\n---\n\n## 如果你要指定某个 agent 干活，最简单的说法是：\n你直接对我说：\n\n- **让情报员去查一下这个问题**\n- **让执行官去改这个文件**\n- **让审查官复核一下这份方案**\n- **让验收官测一下这个流程**\n\n我会按你的意思派单，不需要你记 sessionKey。\n\n---\n\n## 更稳的指定方式\n你可以直接用这种句式：\n\n### 指定 research\n- 让 **情报员** 查一下 OpenClaw 最近的 GitHub bug\n- 让 **research** 去搜社区里有没有人踩过这个坑\n\n### 指定 execution\n- 让 **执行官** 直接改\n- 让 **execution** 去跑命令验证一下\n\n### 指定 review\n- 让 **审查官** 复核这份计划有没有漏洞\n- 让 **review** 看看这个方案靠不靠谱\n\n### 指定 qa\n- 让 **验收官** 测一下这个功能\n- 让 **qa** 做复现和验收\n\n也就是说：  \n**你既可以说中文名，也可以说原英文名。**  \n我都能识别，只要别太模糊。\n\n---\n\n## 最推荐的调用规则\n为了避免歧义，你以后可以固定这样说：\n\n- **查资料 / 找线索** → 情报员\n- **改东西 / 跑命令 / 真执行** → 执行官\n- **复核方案 / 找漏洞 / 挑毛病** → 审查官\n- **测试 / 验收 / 复现** → 验收官\n\n一句话记忆：\n\n**情报员负责找，执行官负责做，审查官负责挑，验收官负责测。**\n\n---\n\n## 能不能直接把 agent 名字真的改掉？\n**能。**  \n但这里分两种：\n\n### 1）只改你日常称呼\n最简单。  \n你以后直接用我上面这套中文名叫他们，我内部帮你映射，不一定非要改系统配置。\n\n### 2）连配置里的 agentId / botName 一起改\n这也能做，但会涉及：\n- agent 配置\n- 绑定关系\n- 可能的 sessionKey / 路由标识\n- 现有工作流兼容性\n\n这个就属于**正式改名**，要改得干净，别留下旧引用。\n\n---\n\n## 我的建议\n**先别急着改系统配置。**  \n先用中文别名跑一阵子，确认你叫着顺手，再决定要不要正式改。\n\n### 我建议你从现在开始这样叫：\n- research = 情报员\n- execution = 执行官\n- review = 审查官\n- qa = 验收官\n\n---\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接帮你做两件事里的一个：\n\n1. **给这 4 个 agent 设计一套最终命名方案（中文 / 中英混合 / 更有人格感）**\n2. **直接检查你当前配置，给出“正式改名”的改法和影响清单**\n\n你回我一句：  \n**“给我一套最终命名方案”**  \n或者  \n**“直接检查配置怎么改名”**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04a96f220883d2240169bc0a1d30c081919c8a231e41898abf\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":3337,"output":953,"cacheRead":22528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26818,"cost":{"input":0.008342500000000001,"output":0.014295,"cacheRead":0.005632,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.028269500000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773931029756}}
{"type":"message","id":"c07d0bc3","parentId":"503edbe0","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:46:11.450Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54f48de8b4b4b288047b12b34a8\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-19 22:46 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54f48de8b4b4b288047b12b34a8]\n范: 正式改名\n统一这几个agent的workspace文件夹命名，统一改为workspace-xx\nqa名称改为薇薇，id改为weiwei，workspace文件夹改为 workspace-wei\n其它几个：\nreview名称熬熬，id为aoao，文件夹改为workspace-ao\nexecution名称玲玲，id为ling，文件夹改为workspace-lingling\nresearch名称兮兮，id为xixi，文件夹改为workspace-xixi\n\n除此之外，你看看哪些配置文件需要修改，一起改好，避免留下bug"}],"timestamp":1773931571446}}
