oyWUWkgP1IRz5HwDnIBrcW8A9ZYgwHqoUqnl_MLEfU-BmbrmPa6Q8k04eg==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Inspecting configuration**\\n\\nI need to inspect the configuration, as it seems like modifying files is acceptable if the user explicitly asks. It might be best to consider using a skill, but I'm not sure if that's necessary here. I should also check my memory for prior preferences. Involving execution could be an option, but I think I can handle it myself. I’ll inspect the workspace and maybe do a quick review to find the files I need!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我先把相关配置和引用点找全，再一次性改，避免改一半留下脏引用。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04a96f220883d2240169bc0c3af9ac819197e148492ff73e2b\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_nVxuDsuIySHgZaUWEHnzcNhL|fc_04a96f220883d2240169bc0c3b02a08191ac77a98e57e8c98e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pwd && ls -la && echo '--- openclaw.json candidates ---' && find /root/.openclaw -maxdepth 3 \\( -name 'openclaw.json' -o -name '*.json' -o -name 'AGENTS.md' -o -name 'SOUL.md' \\) | sed 's#^#/ #' | head -300 && echo '--- search old ids/names ---' && rg -n \"agent:research|agent:execution|agent:review|agent:qa|research|execution|review|\\bqa\\b|workspace-research|workspace-execution|workspace-review|workspace-qa|ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24|ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713|ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506|oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\" /root/.openclaw 2>/dev/null | head -500","yieldMs":10000,"workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"pwd && ls -la && echo '--- openclaw.json candidates ---' && find /root/.openclaw -maxdepth 3 \\\\( -name 'openclaw.json' -o -name '*.json' -o -name 'AGENTS.md' -o -name 'SOUL.md' \\\\) | sed 's#^#/ #' | head -300 && echo '--- search old ids/names ---' && rg -n \\\"agent:research|agent:execution|agent:review|agent:qa|research|execution|review|\\\\bqa\\\\b|workspace-research|workspace-execution|workspace-review|workspace-