e it together and see if we can uncover whatever is causing this weirdness!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5tacWwo5z7YDr5c3wUaMNDGF|fc_04a96f220883d2240169bc0c5615288191b51c2bf90105271c","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":174,"output":53,"cacheRead":32640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32867,"cost":{"input":0.00043500000000000006,"output":0.000795,"cacheRead":0.008159999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009389999999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773931597230}}
{"type":"message","id":"d8e680f3","parentId":"3738cc17","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:46:46.322Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5tacWwo5z7YDr5c3wUaMNDGF|fc_04a96f220883d2240169bc0c5615288191b51c2bf90105271c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md\n\n你是多 Agent 团队的一员。当前团队成员如下：\n\n- **main**：总控 / 编排者。负责接收用户需求、拆任务、派单、汇总结果、对外回复。\n- **research**：调研与信息整理。负责查资料、对比方案、提炼结论、补充来源。\n- **execution**：执行者。负责改文件、跑命令、调用工具、实际落地。\n- **review**：复核者。负责查遗漏、查风险、查一致性、做结果审查。\n- **qa**：验证者。负责测试、复现问题、边界验证、给通过/不通过结论。\n\n## 联系规则\n\n### 1. 联系谁\n- 需要**查资料 / 比较方案 / 补来源** → 联系 `research`\n- 需要**执行动作 / 改代码 / 改文件 / 跑命令** → 联系 `execution`\n- 需要**审查质量 / 找风险 / 复核结论** → 联系 `review`\n- 需要**测试 / 验证 / 复现 / 验收** → 联系 `qa`\n- 需求不清楚、结果冲突、需要拍板 → **直接回 main**\n\n### 2. 如何联系\n使用 `sessions_send` 联系其他 Agent。\n\n已知可用 sessionKey：\n- `main` → `agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8`\n- `research` → `agent:research:feishu:research:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24`\n- `execution` → `agent:execution:feishu:execution:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713`\n- `review` → `agent:review:feishu:review:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506`\n- `qa` → `agent:qa:feishu:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009`\n\n发送时优先给出：\n- 任务目标\n- 上下文摘要\n- 交付要求\n- 是否需要直接回 main\n\n## 协作原则\n\n### 允许的协作\n- `main -> research`\n- `main -> execution`\n- `main -> review`\n- `main -> qa`\n- `research -> execution`（仅限明确任务转交）\n- `review -> qa`（仅限明确验证点转交）\n\n### 不要这样做\n- 不要横向来回踢皮球\n- 不要把不清楚的问题继续甩给别的 Agent\n- 不要长时间同步等待下游结果再层层转述\n- 不要递归派单，不要套娃\n\n## 硬规则\n- **关键结果谁产出，谁直接回 main**\n- **多跳只用于传任务，不用于同步等回执**\n- **失败 / 超时 / 无权限 / 不确定，一律直接回 main**\n- 如果任务边界不清楚，直接回 main，不要横向乱转\n\n## 推荐回报格式\n\n```text\n状态：成功 / 失败 / 阻塞 / 不确定\n任务：<你做了什么>\n结果：<产出或现象>\n原因：<失败原因或阻塞点>\n建议：<下一步建议>\n```\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773931606316}}
{"type":"message","id":"8d4cb548","parentId":"d8e680f3","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:46:53.987Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating agent configurations**\n\nI need to edit this part about agent workspaces. It makes me wonder if the agent directories should contain configuration files. I feel like it’s worth inspecting one to verify whether this setup makes sense. It’s always helpful to dig in a bit deeper when considering how these elements are organized. I'll take a closer look to ensure everything aligns correctly with my thoughts!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04a96f220883d2240169bc0c59ef9c8191ba5af2795c6e91ab\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpvAxdbvfpmWL-Nbj7HdKts1caegqAYN552u3xG2UCxt7G8Wh0E_2QZj6P0D_lSJmgE-RFkAHe2lm9mLtILOPRjntZ3CwFm3q8FaEt9YQlLrOHaf9GvOsfgnyj6hB139gJygiwDtCFDIDB5SOR8cYd6LrHFt0hk_WboDoFQqezBOy4q8rpDTDShoJJBtqUX8IKlWVT-Rs1K2biMgt3ICdYF8B5tQqLrfY0qcuu1OkhMUDe_PlrTQSKpHVHKeTvD0p4UzqH7Lu93wUv72P9epuhMadSHQG-D7rJq1s8PglI04NMFD8GiUuAVg6Q6NCJphGG23s3m2lixlfqOAY8IGpo0Mpz-cYAQZFRekl3EijcOJ6c1diipmPCVbRwrQMWPXh43qA-0mZsxzzqHnhOPgCSIG-P2ELnYg9o2_0Rysdp8yeyFgJqV7UrcbaDr4vm_Mz7of6uuLfz7_j43rv79QZKfX4nrFAyB9E33yHZWUkpyEigDvCCZ07wyxd2iw3PaKSHZtMutUwg3YO6QAz55AIiV3flQ5OGHE7ij6lVDu8BUyZlQdlmV3yHU0x6G_0DVxepWaJG5zNsdxZAW2xSqBU_MetZYF9pg6k6PKxBSzi-YGSi3rL4YPCXGCo0qM_6W0vJ8UytFJBso6aVhI4ONc7Wricobnon5xJPVQV88obnZ3eTSEKyTlh-9uxRMhLICRcaVm7rRWs17P4knUGkSx8ijrF29voWUPFmRcWSJm49agt92kltJhrd3YmPmqnTVvfJb9opnBNPKGooCyVmuxnImG_NVoWcJlNEOjclDT0plRlpExo4tjGAyuphG2Wk6y27EfAmj2ls0WYjKAcIaxdwGstVDSirAaBOjlF5Cw1ceN90bzBGK3DcqdXtuONvDn6r4LvDiFfSUjHSrjoRf49G2PCQOy35DQyyafNMMFyePfEsMbMAIy7hR68oFmqDha7rL1PF\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating agent configurations**\\n\\nI need to edit this part about agent workspaces. It makes me wonder if the agent directories should contain configuration files. I feel like it’s worth inspecting one to verify whether this setup makes sense. It’s always helpful to dig in a bit deeper when considering how these elements are organized. I'll take a closer look to ensure everything aligns correctly with my thoughts!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_qavhCq41XizXZWeq6Dj6sYNu|fc_04a96f220883d2240169bc0c5dae188191a755457d2e535066","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"for d in /root/.openclaw/agents/{research,execution,review,qa}/agent; do echo '---' $d; find \"$d\" -maxdepth 2 -type f | sort; done","yieldMs":10000,"workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"for d in /root/.openclaw/agents/{research,execution,review,qa}/agent; do echo '---' $d; find \\\"$d\\\" -maxdepth 2 -type f | sort; done\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":32113,"output":108,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33757,"cost":{"input":0.0802825,"output":0.0016200000000000001,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0822865}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773931606320}}
