件加载日志，**还没拿到明确报错原因**\n  - 我下一步要把失败原因挖出来，然后修掉，确保新命名真正生效\n\n### 当前结论\n**静态配置迁移已完成，动态生效还差最后的 gateway 重启验证。**\n\n如果你同意，我下一步就继续直接排查这次 restart 失败原因，给你收尾。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04a96f220883d2240169bc0d84a6708191b5711679fed39321\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":131,"output":415,"cacheRead":50304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50850,"cost":{"input":0.00032750000000000005,"output":0.0062250000000000005,"cacheRead":0.012575999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0191285}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773931904177}}
